    "125B6D39426E0579373E7186102A074A": "The World's Greatest Detective (AKA me, Batman) needs your help. My enemies are working together to steal buildings from Gotham City. Kinda nice to see them getting along, actually... Uh, not that I wish I had my own collaborator or anything... *sigh* ANYwho, investigate the pieces of Gotham City you find and I'll share some proprietary flying tech: blueprints for <empha>The Bat</>. <emphasis>Clear 3 Gotham Challenges.</>",
